   "depth": 4
  },
  {
   "kind": "text",
   "level": "H2",
   "text": "Contact an Expert",
   "compId": "comp-lcp2u9yh1",
   "depth": 4
  },
  {
   "kind": "text",
   "level": null,
   "text": "Contact a local fishing guide or bait shop to get the latest information on area ice conditions.\u00a0 These experts are on the ice daily and they can help ensure you have a safe trip.\u00a0 In the Detroit Lakes area, you can call the experts listed below.",
   "compId": "comp-lcp2u9yj",
